  "notes": "{和|やわ}らぐ expresses the softening or easing of something intense, harsh, or tense.\n\nVERB TYPE:\n- Godan verb (ぐ-verb)\n- Intransitive\n- Transitive pair: ⟦{和|やわ}らげる→和らげる：07897_yawarageru⟧\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{痛|いた}み→痛み：01795_itami⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{和|やわ}らぐ (pain eases)\n- ⟦{緊張|きんちょう}→緊張：02494_kinchou⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{和|やわ}らぐ (tension eases)\n- ⟦{表情|ひょうじょう}→表情：03585_hyoujou⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{和|やわ}らぐ (expression softens)\n- ⟦{寒|さむ}さ→寒さ：12336_samusa⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{和|やわ}らぐ (cold eases)\n- ⟦{怒|いか}り→怒り：01780_ikari⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{和|やわ}らぐ (anger subsides)\n- {気持|きも}ち⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{和|やわ}らぐ (feelings calm down)\n\nTRANSITIVE PAIR:\n- {和|やわ}らぐ (intransitive): The pain eases on its own\n- ⟦{和|やわ}らげる→和らげる：07897_yawarageru⟧ (transitive): Someone eases/softens something\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{和|やわ}らげる→和らげる：07897_yawarageru⟧ (transitive: to ease, soften)\n- ⟦{落|お}ち{着|つ}く→落ち着く：04670_ochitsuku⟧ (to calm down)\n- ⟦{収|おさ}まる→収まる：11858_osamaru⟧ (to subside)\n- ⟦{緩|ゆる}む→緩む：10056_yurumu⟧ (to loosen, relax)\n\nREGISTER: Neutral to slightly formal. Common in everyday use.",
